# Tinker Click

> Tinker Click makes apps from plain descriptions. You tell it what you need in your own words, and it builds a focused app for that one job, ready to use on your desktop. No setup, no templates, no technical know-how. Made by Gepsoft, Lda, in Portugal.

The home page takes email sign-ups for the waitlist. People can publish the apps they make, and a published app lives at https://tinker.click/<handle>/<name>.

## Pages

- [Home](https://tinker.click/): what Tinker Click is, and the waitlist sign-up
- [Download](https://tinker.click/downloads/): Tinker Click for Windows, macOS and Linux
- [Privacy notice](https://tinker.click/privacy/): what Tinker Click does with personal data, why, for how long, and your rights; tinker.click sets no cookies and runs no ads, tracking or analytics
- [Terms of Service](https://tinker.click/tos/): the terms for the apps, accounts, the library server and pages published at tinker.click
- [Licence](https://tinker.click/licence/): the GNU Affero General Public License, version 3, in 170 plain words and in full
